TEXT 304 184 Left 2 !.PARAM U_N=220  U_D={3.8*U_N} T=20m  k=9  f={1/T}  Tp={T/k}  pi=3.1416\n \nVsaege saege 0  PULSE({1.8*U_N} {-1.8*U_N} 0 {Tp/2-1n} {Tp/2-1n} 2n {Tp})\nRsaege saege 0  1\n \nEst1  1  0  VALUE={1.414*U_N*cos(2*pi*f*TIME)} tripdv=0 tripdt=0\nRst1  1  0  1\nEst2  2  0  VALUE={1.414*U_N*cos(2*pi*f*TIME-2*pi/3)} tripdv=0 tripdt=0\nRst2  2  0  1\nEst3  3  0  VALUE={1.414*U_N*cos(2*pi*f*TIME-4*pi/3)} tripdv=0 tripdt=0\nRst3  3  0  1\nE1    U1 0  VALUE={U_D/2*(TABLE(v(saege)-v(1),-1u,1,1u,-1))} tripdv=0 tripdt=0\nE2    V1 0  VALUE={U_D/2*(TABLE(v(saege)-v(2),-1u,1,1u,-1))} tripdv=0 tripdt=0\nE3    W1 0  VALUE={U_D/2*(TABLE(v(saege)-v(3),-1u,1,1u,-1))} tripdv=0 tripdt=0
